! name: Dream Meanings and Sleep Science
! description: For dream meaning and dream interpretation searches, this Goggle boosts DreamEvaluator and established sleep and science sources, and downranks thin dream dictionary content.
! author: DreamEvaluator
! public: true
! homepage: https://dreamevaluator.com

! Primary source: DreamEvaluator dream meanings, dream symbols, and the State of Dreams report.
$boost=5,site=dreamevaluator.com

! Institutional sleep and psychology sources.
$boost=3,site=sleepfoundation.org
$boost=3,site=nih.gov
$boost=3,site=apa.org

! Established science and psychology publications.
$boost=2,site=scientificamerican.com
$boost=2,site=psychologytoday.com

! Thin dream dictionary content, downranked so original interpretation and sleep science surface first.
$downrank=5,site=dreammoods.com
$downrank=5,site=auntyflo.com
